    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Real Cities in 3D\u2014Build the Future Step by Step</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a work-in-progress urban sandbox powered by real-world city data. Fly, drive, or walk through cities like San Francisco, New York, London, and Paris, and start reshaping them with early tools\u2014place buildings, tweak layouts, and experiment in high-fidelity 3D. We\u2019re not a full city builder <i>yet</i>\u2014think of this as the foundation. Roads, deeper construction, and economic sim features are coming fast, fueled by your feedback. Our dream? SimCity for real cities. Join us in early access to reimagine urban icons, one update at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Here Now</strong>: Navigation, basic building placement, real-city exploration.<br><strong>What\u2019s Next</strong>: Road tools (March 2025), more structures, city systems.<br><strong>Your Vision. Your Input. Our Cities.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Real Cities in 3D\u2014Build the Future Step by Step</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a work-in-progress urban sandbox powered by real-world city data. Fly, drive, or walk through cities like San Francisco, New York, London, and Paris, and start reshaping them with early tools\u2014place buildings, tweak layouts, and experiment in high-fidelity 3D. We\u2019re not a full city builder <i>yet</i>\u2014think of this as the foundation. Roads, deeper construction, and economic sim features are coming fast, fueled by your feedback. Our dream? SimCity for real cities. Join us in early access to reimagine urban icons, one update at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Here Now</strong>: Navigation, basic building placement, real-city exploration.<br><strong>What\u2019s Next</strong>: Road tools (March 2025), more structures, city systems.<br><strong>Your Vision. Your Input. Our Cities.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Geopogo Cities: Explore real cities\u2014SF, NY, London, Miami\u2014in 3D. Place buildings, tweak layouts, and roam urban icons in early access. Roads, systems, and expanded tools coming to build a full city sim. Shape the future with us!",
